## Achilles, Proud

@achilles: You reached the surface. I knew you would.

<branch id="gift">
<choice id="accept" label="Accept the spear">
@achilles: Take it. It served me well.
::assert{befriended(achilles)}
</choice>
<choice id="decline" label="Decline">
@achilles: Suit yourself, lad.
</choice>
</branch>
